TITLE pe for 5 mmol/kgw C(-4) with fixed gas phase CH4(g)=0 at 15 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 15
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    pe 0
    C(-4) 5.0
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1.0
    -temperature 15
    CH4(g) 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pe true
END
